{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3326","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3326","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3326\",\"parent_revision\":\"d369be258dc61f7fae56d4464de5c7fd08eb39c7e0c5483926d72a20b64ae299\",\"root_revision\":\"d369be258dc61f7fae56d4464de5c7fd08eb39c7e0c5483926d72a20b64ae299\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-29\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDuring #3151's implementation, the `t0-baseline-capture` agent (task T0, plan `Pd95e593c`) registered a `T0-baseline` artifact that does not correspond to the plan's real acceptance criteria at all.\\n\\nThe plan's `acceptance-criteria-structured` list defines 8 real criteria (`AC1-no-fabricated-paths` through `AC8-repo-root-docs-clean`), each with an exact `check-command`. Instead, the registered baseline artifact recorded three unrelated, generic criteria \u2014 `sam-task-file-format-yaml`, `sam-task-field-validation`, `sam-task-id-pattern` \u2014 with check-commands like `find plan -name 'P*.yaml' | wc -l` that have no relationship to any of the plan's actual 8 acceptance criteria.\\n\\nThe agent's own completion report at the time said it captured \\\"three validation criteria checks\\\", which in hindsight should have been caught immediately as a mismatch against the plan's 8 real criteria \u2014 the orchestrator only verified that an artifact existed, not its content, before marking T0 complete, which is the process gap that let this through undetected until TN verification.\\n\\n**Consequence for #3151**: no valid T0 baseline existed for the real criteria, so a true baseline-vs-final delta comparison was impossible. TN verification for #3151 proceeded by running all 8 real check-commands directly against final HEAD and confirming each matched its `expected-final` value \u2014 a legitimate substitute for correctness, but it does not fulfill the T0/TN bookend design this agent exists to serve.\\n\\n**Hypothesis**: `t0-baseline-capture`'s own instructions may not correctly resolve/read the plan's `acceptance-criteria-structured` field before generating criteria to check \u2014 worth reading its agent definition and comparing against how `tn-verification-gate` (which worked correctly against the same real criteria) resolves the same data.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-29\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"20d6cdbbaec2a6ed925bb895b0e3558448df2cc9abd0f0130a8a9a4ad00bd797\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRaDOgw\"}"}